      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "UNCLE TREV (5) was 4.5 metres away in third at Shepparton over 2190m last start at his first run back from a spell. Fresh and pulling there behind runners from the second row. Now goes off the front and can make that count. ARCHAA (3) is racing in tremendous fashion with four wins and three minor placings from the past seven runs. Went close again last time over 1690m at this track, finishing third and 4.5 metres from the winner. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Primary contender based on that latest outing. THESTING (6) ended last prep with a third at Ballarat over 2200m. Capable of a forward showing while fresh. SPORTS WRACK (4) is better than his last-start seventh over 2240m at Melton.",
